Name: jmap_max_delayed_send
Type: DURATION
Default-Value: 512d
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

The longest delay, in seconds, that EmailSubmission/set accepts in a
HOLDFOR or HOLDUNTIL parameter, advertised as the maxDelayedSend property
of the JMAP \"urn:ietf:params:jmap:submission\" capabilities object.  A
submission held for longer is rejected, and 0 rejects any hold.
